OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1787808398
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWorld's first patient to undergo
OL,4,Alive AI-assisted brain surgery has
OL,5,Atumour removed
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe AI tool analysed a video feed of
OL,8,Fthe operation as it happened and
OL,9,Fadvised surgeons on how to avoid
OL,10,Fcrucial but hidden vessels and nerves
OL,11,Fin the brain. It allowed them to safely
OL,12,Fremove as much of the tumour as
OL,13,Fpossible.
OL,15,F"From a patient safety perspective, I
OL,16,Fcan see absolutely the benefit. There
OL,17,Fare no road signs inside our head,"
OL,18,Fsaid Hibbert.
